From: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 14:06:01 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mwl8k: recognize the WNR854T PCI device

Add the PCI device ID used by the Netgear WNR854T wireless hardware to
the mwl8k match table.

Original author was not recorded in the imported patch.
[viking.yfy@qq.com: complete imported patch metadata]
Signed-off-by: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
---
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/marvell/mwl8k.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/marvell/mwl8k.c
@@ -5779,6 +5779,7 @@ MODULE_FIRMWARE("mwl8k/fmimage_8366.fw")
 MODULE_FIRMWARE(MWL8K_8366_AP_FW(MWL8K_8366_AP_FW_API));
 
 static const struct pci_device_id mwl8k_pci_id_table[] = {
+	{ PCI_VDEVICE(MARVELL, 0x2a02), .driver_data = MWL8363, },
 	{ PCI_VDEVICE(MARVELL, 0x2a0a), .driver_data = MWL8363, },
 	{ PCI_VDEVICE(MARVELL, 0x2a0c), .driver_data = MWL8363, },
 	{ PCI_VDEVICE(MARVELL, 0x2a24), .driver_data = MWL8363, },
